  <item>
    <title>57. 2026年投资指南：钱往哪投之国内市场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698916b82aaefd8def5c493e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698916b82aaefd8def5c493e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Feb 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2026年投资风向如何把握？本期我们和老朋友Dallas 从2025年关税大战、重仓银行股说起，深入探讨了特朗普2.0时代的关税博弈、A股“慢牛”逻辑与AI硬科技的爆发，教你如何在波动中利用资产配置穿越周期，实现稳中有升。本对谈不构成实质性投资建议，如有雷同，纯属巧合！</span></p><br><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a>&nbsp;2025年投资战绩复盘（30%-40%收益来源）。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a>&nbsp;宏观博弈：&nbsp;应对特朗普关税的“恐吓策略”，判断市场情绪与本质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>&nbsp;资产轮动：&nbsp;从银行股（农行）红利逻辑到硬科技（AI）趋势的切换</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>&nbsp;避坑与心法：&nbsp;逆向投资思维，识别公司道德风险（以乐视为例）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a>&nbsp;选股逻辑：&nbsp;普通人如何通过毛利率判断护城河，避开内卷行业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a>2026展望：&nbsp;A股“慢牛”与政策托底逻辑，资金面与信心的博弈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a>美股分析：&nbsp;美国盈利驱动的长牛逻辑，美债与降息的影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a>基金实操：&nbsp;选基就是选人，如何识别靠谱基金经理与量化基金</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">63:00</a>资产配置：&nbsp;年轻人与稳健派的配置比例，利用低相关性平滑风险</span></p><br><p><span>【主持人】图道 曾任职于世界500强咨询公司 中国企业数字化转型的见证者、参与者;前阿里巴巴高级业务专家</span><br><span>【嘉宾】Dallas&nbsp; 投资者，前外企高管</span><br></p><p><span>【加主播VX，链接刷子资源】</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/e829-audiofreehighqps/DA/F0/GKwRIW4NXibDAAInhgRn7fdR.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""></p><br><br>]]></description>
