    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>内地利率跌跌不休，A股房产起伏揪心，钱还能放哪儿？这期节目深聊香港保险：美元复利6%＋、全球多元配置、保单融资加杠杆、重疾教育养老一站打包。从“小白避坑”到“高阶玩法”，真实客户故事＋12年港险老兵干货，教你把家庭资产装进制胜“方舟”。锁定终身稳健收益，听完再决定！</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>　主持人开场：为什么现在必须聊香港保险？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a>　嘉宾Nicole：阴差阳错入行12年，亲历行业三轮爆发</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>　历史回顾：港险如何成高净值人群“避风港”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>　理财金字塔模型：港险在“地基＋保值层”不可替代的角色</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a>　四大PK：港险 VS 房产/黄金/股票/固收——流动性、复利、传承、隔离全对比</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>　美元＋港元策略：普通人如何5万美金额度内做全球资产配置</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a>　产品速览：重疾｜储蓄分红｜万用寿险｜保费融资，一张图看懂适用场景</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">68:00</a>　安全合规：赴港投保全流程、银联刷卡误区、续费理赔Tips</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">68:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">78:00</a>　高阶玩法：保单融资3–4倍杠杆，年化10%＋，银行为什么更爱保单抵押</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5280">88:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5700">95:00</a>　复利魔法：6.5%滚雪球背后的投资底层逻辑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5700">95:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6180">103:00</a>　四类人群配置方案：年轻人、宝妈、企业主、高净值家庭分别怎么买</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6180">103:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6300">105:00</a>　保险的流动性是个问题</span><br></p><br><p><span>【主持人】图道 曾任职于世界500强咨询公司 中国企业数字化转型的见证者、参与者;前阿里巴巴高级业务专家</span><br><span>【嘉宾】Nicole&nbsp; 资深香港理财从业者</span><br></p><br><p><span>【加主播VX，链接刷子资源】</span></p><br><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/5e40-audiofreehighqps/1D/2E/GAqhp50M-FJXAAInhgQ6mO71.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p>]]></description>
